OL,3,GNEWSACordon remains after '250kg WW2
OL,4,Amissile' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 300m (984ft) cordon remains in place
OL,7,Ffor a second day after a suspected
OL,8,Funexploded bomb was found in a dock in
OL,9,FCornwall.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FFalmouth Docks at 09:15 BST on Monday
OL,13,Fafter a suspected 250kg (550lb)
OL,14,FAmerican World War Two missile was
OL,15,Ffound in the water.
OL,17,FDevon and Cornwall Police said three
OL,18,Fresidential properties had been
OL,19,Fevacuated as a precaution and urged the
OL,20,Fpublic to stay away from restricted
OL,21,Fzones.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
