OL,3,GNEWSACordon remains after '250kg WW2
OL,4,Amissile' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist Explosive Ordnance Disposal
OL,7,F(EOD) were "assessing the device" and
OL,8,FFalmouth Harbour said "the object will
OL,9,Fbe moved for disposal", officers added.
